{"s":"PREMIERENE","u":20261021,"readme":{"what":"Daily history of one F&O underlying from the official NSE UDiFF F&O bhavcopy. Column format: every key listed in cols is an array parallel to days (oldest first). null = not available that day (e.g. untraded contract has no candle). Days on which the underlying has no contracts are absent.","days":"trade date as YYYYMMDD integer","spot":"underlying price in the bhavcopy (index level / stock cash price)","o,h,l,c":"near-month futures open, high, low, close (c = settlement-based close price of the file). The near-month contract rolls to the next expiry on the expiry day itself. o/h/l are null when the contract did not trade that day or the candle was inconsistent","fx":"expiry (YYYYMMDD) of the near-month futures contract used for o,h,l,c,v","v":"near-month futures volume (units)","vt":"futures volume of all expiries (units)","oi":"total futures open interest, all expiries (units)","doi":"change in total futures open interest vs previous day, all expiries (units)","coi":"total call open interest, all expiries (units)","poi":"total put open interest, all expiries (units)","pcr":"put OI / call OI over all expiries (3 decimals)","pcrn":"put OI / call OI of the nearest option expiry","nx":"nearest option expiry (YYYYMMDD) used for pcrn, mp, hc, hp (an expiry on the trade date counts as over, same rule as the futures roll)","mp":"max pain strike of the nearest option expiry (strike with the lowest total payout to option writers; lowest strike wins a tie)","hc,hp":"strike with the highest call OI / highest put OI in the nearest option expiry","roll":"dates (YYYYMMDD) on which the near-month futures contract differs from the previous day in this file","u":"last data date in this file (YYYYMMDD)","units":"OI and volume in units (quantity), not lots"},"cols":["spot","o","h","l","c","fx","v","vt","oi","doi","coi","poi","pcr","pcrn","nx","mp","hc","hp"],"days":[20260612,20260615,20260616,20260617,20260618,20260619,20260622,2026062